<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Statoil suspends testing in Connemara field.</title>
<headline>Statoil suspends testing in Connemara field.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Statoil said on Friday an extended well test in the primary reservoir at its Connemara field did not live up to expectations and it had suspended further testing of the well.</p>
<p>Statoil said in a statement it was now concentrating on drilling the next well in the secondary reservoir, which is planned to be tested through normal a well test in mid- September.</p>
</text>
